WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.990
Your curiosity deserves room to wander.

2
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:12.990
Meet BlackYT: your Android companion for music, talks and learning on the move. Find a creator. Follow an idea.

3
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:16.010
Build a queue that follows your curiosity.

4
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:22.930
Save an episode. Come back later, and pick up where you left off.

5
00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.650
Put your phone in your pocket, and keep listening with the screen off.

6
00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:40.730
BlackYT adds no in-app ads. YT and Google still receive search and streaming requests. Creator sponsorships may remain.

7
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.990
Make Explore your own. Keep your next discovery close.

8
00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:56.110
BlackYT. Stay in the flow. Get the Android app through the GitHub link in the description.
